     "object": "a_chavruta_klapei_shmaya",
     "gloss_en": "חברותא כלפי שמיא מי איכא?! -- one may not treat Heaven with such familiarity; if he did not direct his mind at first, we strike him with a smith's hammer until he does (= p_machinan_bemarzafta)",
